  "homepage": {
    "meta": null,
    "content": {
      "raw": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-hero-v2 has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#061129 0%,#101B49 52%,#65182E 100%);background-color:#091746;padding-top:74px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:84px;padding-left:22px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em\">✦ 2026–2027 TÜRKİYE TURNESİ ✦</p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,76px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.05\">ULUSLARARASI<br>MILANO SİRKİ</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:23px;font-weight:700\">Büyüleyici bir sahne macerasına hazır mısınız?</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7\">Akrobasi, denge, jonglörlük ve kahkaha dolu performanslarla bütün aile için unutulmaz gösteri deneyimi.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"#gosteri-takvimi\" style=\"border-radius:40px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#C72528;padding-top:16px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:26px\">Gösteri Takvimi</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/milanosirkiturkiye/\" style=\"border-radius:40px;color:#091746;background-color:#F5C04A;padding-top:16px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:26px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instagram'da Takip Et</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">✦ Hayvansız Gösteri &nbsp; · &nbsp; 50–60 Dakika &nbsp; · &nbsp; Ailece Eğlence</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:45%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:28px;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:22px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:22px;padding-left:22px;box-shadow:0 25px 75px rgba(0,0,0,.30);border:3px solid #F5C04A\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"https://milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/milano-sirki-resmi-logo.webp\" alt=\"Uluslararası Milano Sirki resmi logosu\" class=\"wp-image-7\"/></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-stage-illustration-v1 has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#091746;padding-top:34px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:40px;padding-left:22px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em\">✦ MİLANO SAHNE ATMOSFERİ ✦</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\" style=\"border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.22)\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=1024%2C585&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Lacivert ve bordo renkli, altın spot ışıklarıyla aydınlatılmış temsili sirk sahnesi illüstrasyonu\" class=\"wp-image-72\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=300%2C171&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=768%2C439&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=1024%2C585&amp;ssl=1 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1100px) calc(100vw - 44px), 1024px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" style=\"border-radius:24px;display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:13px\">Tanıtım amaçlı temsili illüstrasyon · Gerçek gösteri fotoğrafı değildir.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\" style=\"padding-top:70px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:70px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#C72528;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em\">SAHNEDE HEYECAN, KALPLERDE MUTLULUK</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px)\">Perde açıldığında macera başlar</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Renkli, hayvansız sahne gösterimizde ustalık, ritim ve eğlence bir araya geliyor.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:20px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFF0C7;padding-top:28px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#091746\">Akrobasi</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Çeviklik ve ustalığın nefes kesen sahne anlarına dönüştüğü performanslar.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:20px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFF0C7;padding-top:28px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#091746\">Denge &amp; Jonglörlük</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Her hareketinde merak uyandıran, ritim ve koordinasyon dolu gösteriler.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:20px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFF0C7;padding-top:28px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#091746\">Ailece Eğlence</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Palyaço sürprizleri ve renkli sahne anlarıyla hep birlikte gülümseyin.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-ui-cards-v1 has-background\" style=\"background-color:#F7F5F0;padding-top:76px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:80px;padding-left:22px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:13px;font-weight:800\">✦ &nbsp; MİLANO SİRKİ DÜNYASI</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:38px;font-weight:800\">Sahnenin büyüsü, her ekranda</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#39435A;font-size:17px;font-weight:400\">Gösterilerimizi keşfedin, turnemizi takip edin ve bize kolayca ulaşın. Tüm bilgiler tek bir yerde.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#091746;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">✦ &nbsp; 01 / SAHNE</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Gösterilerimiz</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Akrobasi, denge, jonglörlük ve palyaço performansları.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/gosterilerimiz/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">◉ &nbsp; 02 / TURNE</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Şehirler ve gösteriler</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Türkiye turnesi duyurularını ve program bilgilerini takip edin.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/sehirler/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#BD1D2D;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFE6A5;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">★ &nbsp; 03 / ÖZEL ETKİNLİK</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Kurumsal organizasyonlar</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Okul, belediye, festival ve şirket etkinlikleri için iş birliği.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#FFE6A5;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/kurumsal-organizasyonlar/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFE8AF;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#8B1721;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">◇ &nbsp; 04 / REHBER</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Bilet ve sık sorulanlar</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Gösteri süresi, yaş grupları ve giriş bilgilerini öğrenin.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#8B1721;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/sikca-sorulan-sorular/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:22px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:25px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:25px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(9,23,70,.08)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">✉ &nbsp; Sorunuz mu var?</p>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#39435A;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Milano Sirki ekibine doğrudan <a href=\"https://wa.me/905363583381\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8p